        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-21T00:12:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I honestly don't think the big cosmic villain is going to be in WotC - I think it'll be in the final set. I think WotC is going to be build-up to that, giving us a glimpse of the worlds and realms beyond the Earth of Sentinels.</p><p>Just a guess, though...</p>",
